🎉 Excited to Share My Second Task at Prodigy InfoTech! 🎉

💢 I’ve just completed my second task as part of the Prodigy InfoTech team, where I developed a Guessing Game that challenges users to guess a randomly generated number.

💢 The application allows users to:
✨ Enter their guesses interactively.
✨ Receive feedback on whether their guess is too high or too low.
✨ Continue guessing until they find the correct number.

💢 Key Features:
✅ Generates a random number between 1 and 100.
✅ Keeps track of the number of attempts.
✅ Handles invalid inputs gracefully, preventing errors or crashes.

🎃 This task helped me refine my Java programming skills, especially in handling user input and implementing game logic. Looking forward to more exciting challenges at Prodigy InfoTech! 🚀
